    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get things done while heroes defeat enemies in this<strong> idle</strong>\u00a0at the corner of your screen!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique heroes from multiple timelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/6d30481ce3e420db691956c108788ff6.webp?t=1749229341\" width=640 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect all timelines under attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/1e4b8022619bd268d82f084d4af2095e.webp?t=1749229341\" width=636 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build structures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress to unlock structures that will help your heroes fight evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/eb0da24944be6858481444aa4048b975.webp?t=1749229341\" width=624 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prestige</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After long battles collecting gold in different timelines, convert all of it into <strong>Prestige Points</strong>, which makes heroes deal even more damage and allow you to upgrade powerful structures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/65d2bb8b98cba5c8bf87887e10ed1c6a.webp?t=1749229341\" width=16 height=16 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring peace!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to enter this timeline of endless battles \u2014 each reset is a new chance to strengthen your heroes and advance even further. Save the universe, timeline by timeline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/e99d04f7fa641e924581b8cb2b241e56.poster.avif?t=1749229341\" width=224 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/e99d04f7fa641e924581b8cb2b241e56.webm?t=1749229341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/e99d04f7fa641e924581b8cb2b241e56.mp4?t=1749229341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get things done while heroes defeat enemies in this<strong> idle</strong>\u00a0at the corner of your screen!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique heroes from multiple timelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/6d30481ce3e420db691956c108788ff6.webp?t=1749229341\" width=640 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect all timelines under attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/1e4b8022619bd268d82f084d4af2095e.webp?t=1749229341\" width=636 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build structures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress to unlock structures that will help your heroes fight evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/eb0da24944be6858481444aa4048b975.webp?t=1749229341\" width=624 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prestige</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After long battles collecting gold in different timelines, convert all of it into <strong>Prestige Points</strong>, which makes heroes deal even more damage and allow you to upgrade powerful structures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/65d2bb8b98cba5c8bf87887e10ed1c6a.webp?t=1749229341\" width=16 height=16 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring peace!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to enter this timeline of endless battles \u2014 each reset is a new chance to strengthen your heroes and advance even further. Save the universe, timeline by timeline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/e99d04f7fa641e924581b8cb2b241e56.poster.avif?t=1749229341\" width=224 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/e99d04f7fa641e924581b8cb2b241e56.webm?t=1749229341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732950/extras/e99d04f7fa641e924581b8cb2b241e56.mp4?t=1749229341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
